# Cleansing in a three-player game: Bot1 pays for nothing, Bot2 chooses to pay for Bot3's Swamp and concedes while Bot3 is
# asked. Bot2's Forest left the game with Bot2 (CR 800.4a) and is not among the lands Bot3 is offered (CR 400.7); Bot3
# pays 1 life for Bot1's Plains, which stays, and the Swamp is destroyed.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Cleansing
Plains
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Island x24
[Bot3 Deck]
Swamp
Island x24
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
Bot3.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Cleansing.Cast
Bot1.Choose()
Bot2.Choose(Swamp)
Bot2.Concede
! Bot3.Choose(Gone.Forest)
Bot3.Choose(Plains)
[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot3.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Cleansing; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains
Bot3.Graveyard = Swamp
